Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; LearnLoop: close the usual gaps in Google Chrome on this computer.
; Uses Chrome's own documented policies. Applies to every Windows account on this computer, parents included.
; Turns off Incognito windows, Guest mode and adding new Chrome profiles.
; To undo, run undo-close-the-gaps.reg. Then restart Chrome. Check chrome://policy to see what is set.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome]
"IncognitoModeAvailability"=dword:00000001
"BrowserGuestModeEnabled"=dword:00000000
"BrowserAddPersonEnabled"=dword:00000000
